 "description": "Dungeon Run bosses A (phase 8 family 07): the 18 Kobolds and Catacombs encounters with a simple clickable hero power (levels 1-7): Waxmancer Sturmi (two ranks), Pathmaker Hamm (two ranks), Blackseed (two ranks), Frostfur, Graves the Cleric, Overseer Mogark (two ranks), Candlebeard (Rank 1; his Rank 2 passive LOOTA_BOSS_31 is family 08's), Thaddock the Thief, Giant Rat, Gnosh the Greatworm, Bristlesnarl, The Mothergloop, Wee Whelp and Bink the Burglar. Boss deck lists are transcribed from hearthstone.wiki.gg boss pages (read 2026-11-13), by card name; tools/dungeon-run-catalog (step 'encounters') resolves the names against facts/violet-hold-2026-09.json, checks every card and writes data/dungeon-run/encounters-v1.json. The tier is the printed hero Health (10 and 20: tier 1; 30 and 40: tier 2; 50 and 60: tier 3), as family 01's Dungeon Run rows.",
 "method": "The wiki's MediaWiki API (action=parse, prop=wikitext) was read for each page and the one deck table of the page transcribed in table order with the table's own counts (a boss page lists one deck for both ranks of a boss). Each page was transcribed twice; the two transcriptions agree and each table sums to the count the page states (30; 10 for the level-1 bosses Giant Rat, Wee Whelp and Bink the Burglar). The wiki's table is built from the client's deck data: some rows name cards that are not in this client's card data (four cards of Graves the Cleric's list) and boss-only cards of other families; each such card is a recorded substitution. Boss-only cards carry their id.",
